the title like,

00:16:56.314 --> 00:16:59.752
"Pride and Prejudice"
or "Eclipse."

00:16:59.752 --> 00:17:01.286
-Ah! Whoa, whoa.

00:17:01.286 --> 00:17:04.389
And then you'll finish it off
with something classic like...

00:17:04.389 --> 00:17:06.624
-"The Color Orange."

00:17:06.624 --> 00:17:08.493
-Yeah, yeah.

00:17:08.493 --> 00:17:10.028
-Is that how
it's gonna go down, Jimbo?

00:17:10.028 --> 00:17:12.831
-Yeah, yeah.
You guys nailed it. That was it.

00:17:12.831 --> 00:17:14.599
Yeah.
-That sounds like a fun bit.

00:17:14.599 --> 00:17:16.835
You should do it.

00:17:16.835 --> 00:17:19.171
-All right.
We'll do it tomorrow.

00:17:19.171 --> 00:17:20.538
Thank you.

00:17:20.538 --> 00:17:25.043
[ Applause ]

00:17:25.043 --> 00:17:26.745
This is exciting.

00:17:26.745 --> 00:17:30.415 line:0%
Tonight "Annie Live!"
premiered on NBC. Yeah.

00:17:30.415 --> 00:17:32.984
It's been a tough year, so NBC
wanted to lift our spirits

00:17:32.984 --> 00:17:36.955
with an orphan singing
about how hard life is.

00:17:36.955 --> 00:17:39.124
Some business news.

00:17:39.124 --> 00:17:40.892
Tesla just announced
two new products

00:17:40.892 --> 00:17:42.093
that are kind of surprising.

00:17:42.093 --> 00:17:45.130 line:0%
First they released
a $50 whistle,

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.832 line:0%
and it sold out immediately.

00:17:47.832 --> 00:17:50.802 line:0%
Then they released
a $2,000 ATV for kids

00:17:50.802 --> 00:17:52.971 line:0%
called the Cyberquad.
Take a look at this.

00:17:55.373 --> 00:17:57.476
Or as parents put it,
"Yeah, here is a whistle.

00:17:57.476 --> 00:17:59.545
Merry Christmas.

00:17:59.545 --> 00:18:02.013
They were out of the quad.
Yeah."

00:18:02.013 --> 00:18:03.882
Oh, on CNN this morning,
they were talking about

00:18:03.882 --> 00:18:06.084
the dangers
of social media for kids.

00:18:06.084 --> 00:18:07.886
And one guy had
a very interesting take.

00:18:07.886 --> 00:18:10.655 line:0%
Listen to this.
-You know, in your view,

00:18:10.655 --> 00:18:12.724 line:0%
how harmful
is Instagram to kids?

00:18:12.724 --> 00:18:14.325 line:0%
-Think a lot of parents
would agree with me on this.

00:18:14.325 --> 00:18:17.296 line:0%
I would you rather give
my 14-year-old son

00:18:17.296 --> 00:18:19.564 line:0%
a bottle of Jack Daniel's
and marijuana

00:18:19.564 --> 00:18:21.699 line:0%
than an Instagram
and a Snap account.

00:18:21.699 --> 00:18:23.668 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:18:23.668 --> 00:18:25.170
[ Applause ]

00:18:30.909 --> 00:18:33.078
-His kid was like, "Okay,
so I guess I'll be drunk,

00:18:33.078 --> 00:18:36.214
high, and on TikTok.
Perfect."

00:18:36.214 --> 00:18:38.250
His son doesn't need
social media.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.285
He's about to be the
most popular kid at school.

00:18:41.687 --> 00:18:42.821
Last night was

00:18:42.821 --> 00:18:44.989
the National Christmas Tree
Lighting

00:18:44.989 --> 00:18:47.359
and, during his speech,
President Biden tried

00:18:47.359 --> 00:18:50.361
