LL Cool J.

00:19:00.338 --> 00:19:02.039
[ Laughter ]
I tell you, what, man.

00:19:02.039 --> 00:19:04.042
He looks like he can still play.

00:19:04.042 --> 00:19:06.444
And I'm not talking
about instruments.

00:19:06.444 --> 00:19:07.779
I'm talking about football
or something.

00:19:07.779 --> 00:19:08.947
[ Laughter ]
That man is --

00:19:08.947 --> 00:19:10.649
Anyway, I tell you what.

00:19:10.649 --> 00:19:14.452
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:19:14.452 --> 00:19:15.419
You know, it wouldn't be
the holidays

00:19:15.419 --> 00:19:16.621
