00:19:16.621 --> 00:19:18.790
that makes you go, "Oh, jeez!
Alright. Alright.

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:21.659
[ Laughter and applause ]
Get him outta here."

00:19:21.659 --> 00:19:23.361
Biden's staff was going,
"Quick, turn on the tree.

00:19:23.361 --> 00:19:24.329
Turn on the tree!"

00:19:24.329 --> 00:19:26.932
[ Laughter ]

00:19:26.932 --> 00:19:28.733
An aide was like,
"How did that happen?"

00:19:28.733 --> 00:19:30.602
Literally the only thing
on the prompter was...

00:19:32.637 --> 00:19:35.807
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:19:35.807 --> 00:19:38.776
To be fair, LL Cool J
did play professional football.

00:19:38.776 --> 00:19:41.045
In the 1999 movie
"Any Given Sunday."

00:19:41.045 --> 00:19:43.648
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:19:43.648 --> 00:19:46.084
It got worse when Biden said,
"Anyway, thanks to --

00:19:46.084 --> 00:19:48.219
