L.L.Bean J."

00:19:48.219 --> 00:19:51.623
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:19:51.623 --> 00:19:53.525
L.L.Bean J.

00:19:53.525 --> 00:19:55.360
Meanwhile, today Biden
was delivering remarks

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.562
on the economy
and he didn't really

00:19:57.562 --> 00:19:59.730
