-[ Baritone ]
The CEOs of not only the --

00:20:02.967 --> 00:20:04.369 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
the -- the -- the suppliers,

00:20:04.369 --> 00:20:07.538 line:0%
but the CEOs
of UPS and FedEx,

00:20:07.538 --> 00:20:10.008 line:0%
which are on track to deliver
more packages than ever.

00:20:13.344 --> 00:20:16.681
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:20:16.681 --> 00:20:18.349
-That was real?
-That's real, yeah.

00:20:18.349 --> 00:20:20.185
There he is, President Groot.

00:20:20.185 --> 00:20:24.790
[ Laughter and applause ]
Obama was like --

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:26.858
[ As Obama ] Sounds like
the job's got you smoking, too.

00:20:26.858 --> 00:20:28.894
[ Laughter ]

00:20:28.894 --> 00:20:31.195
Overnight, Biden suddenly
turned into Brad Garrett.

00:20:31.195 --> 00:20:32.830
[ As Garrett ]
Raymond, Raymond.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.032
[ Laughter ]

00:20:34.032 --> 00:20:35.167
Even Shaq was like --

00:20:35.167 --> 00:20:35.967
[ As Shaq ]
What's up with that voice?

00:20:35.967 --> 00:20:37.035
[ Laughter ]

00:20:40.538 --> 00:20:43.007
This is good news -- last night,
just hours before the deadline,

00:20:43.007 --> 00:20:46.344
Congress reached a deal
to avoid a government shutdown.

00:20:46.344 --> 00:20:49.013
[ Cheering and applause ]
Yes.

00:20:49.013 --> 00:20:50.782
A government shutdown.

00:20:50.782 --> 00:20:52.083
You know these are crazy times,

00:20:52.083 --> 00:20:53.451
when the government
almost shuts down

00:20:53.451 --> 00:20:55.353
and most Americans are like,
"Meh.

00:20:55.353 --> 00:20:57.822
[ Laughter ]
Hey, add it to the pile."

00:20:57.822 --> 00:20:59.557
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, the government is now

00:20:59.557 --> 00:21:01.826
funded through February 18th.

00:21:01.826 --> 00:21:04.128
It's basically Congress'
version of repeatedly clicking

00:21:04.128 --> 00:21:05.964
"Remind me tomorrow"
on a software update.

00:21:05.964 --> 00:21:07.398
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's like, "No, no, I just want

00:21:07.398 --> 00:21:10.502
to check my emails. Not yet, no.
Don't update. Don't."

00:21:10.502 --> 00:21:12.971
Some business news --
Bath &amp; Body Works'

00:21:12.971 --> 00:21:15.740
big annual scented candle sale
starts today...

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:18.043
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:21:18.043 --> 00:21:21.112
...and people take this sale
very seriously.

00:21:21.112 --> 00:21:22.780
This morning,
there was a 30-minute wait

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.516
to even get on the website.

00:21:24.516 --> 00:21:26.184
-Ooh.
-It is so popular that,
this year,

00:21:26.184 --> 00:21:28.719
there's a limit
of 18 candles per customer,

00:21:28.719 --> 00:21:29.887
so you're only allowed to buy

00:21:29.887 --> 00:21:34.158
18 scented Bath &amp; Body Works
candles, max.

00:21:34.158 --> 00:21:34.893
[ Laughter ]

00:21:34.893 --> 00:21:36.961
-Well?

00:21:36.961 --> 00:21:38.363
-Well, what?

00:21:38.363 --> 00:21:41.032
-Well, what 18 Bath &amp; Body Works
candles are you going to buy?

00:21:41.032 --> 00:21:42.334
[ Laughter ]

00:21:42.334 --> 00:21:44.335
-That's easy.
It's a no-brainer.

00:21:44.335 --> 00:21:46.638
Winter Candy Apple,
Mahogany Balsam,

00:21:46.638 --> 00:21:49.407
Mahogany Teakwood, Holiday,
Hot Cocoa &amp; Cream,

00:21:49.407 --> 00:21:51.509
Sugared Snickerdoodle,
Snowflakes &amp; Citrus,

00:21:51.509 --> 00:21:54.278
Flannel, Fresh Balsam,
Peppermint Sugar Cookie,

00:21:54.278 --> 00:21:56.514
Champagne Toast,
Marshmallow Fireside,

00:21:56.514 --> 00:21:58.317
Frosted Cranberry,
Tis the Season,

00:21:58.317 --> 00:22:01.019
Under the Christmas Tree,
Bright Christmas Morning.

00:22:01.019 --> 00:22:02.586
Maybe two classics,
like Vanilla Balsam

00:22:02.586 --> 00:22:03.754
and Frosted Coconut Snowball.

00:22:03.754 --> 00:22:05.924
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:22:05.924 --> 00:22:08.593
-Whoa.

00:22:08.593 --> 00:22:11.062
Wait, you're not --
you're not getting anything

00:22:11.062 --> 00:22:13.197
from Bath &amp; Body Works
White Barn collection?

00:22:13.197 --> 00:22:14.932
What about like
Eucalyptus Snowfall,

00:22:14.932 --> 00:22:17.335
Sweater Weather,
or Iced Cranberry Scone?

00:22:17.335 --> 00:22:19.037
[ Laughter ]
-Whoo!

00:22:19.037 --> 00:22:20.539
-I mean, I guess I could see

00:22:20.539 --> 00:22:23.908
swapping out Mahogany Balsam
for an Iced Vanilla Woods.

00:22:23.908 --> 00:22:25.109
[ Laughter ]
I did have my eye

00:22:25.109 --> 00:22:26.611
on that new metallic jar trio

00:22:26.611 --> 00:22:29.347
with Winterberry Wreath,
Falling Snow, and Midnight Snow.

00:22:29.347 --> 00:22:30.415
I mean, it's two snows in one.

00:22:30.415 --> 00:22:32.884
[ Laughter ]
-Plus, come on.

00:22:32.884 --> 00:22:35.386
This year's Joy Love Peace Hope
collection?

00:22:35.386 --> 00:22:36.721
Two all-new scents --

00:22:36.721 --> 00:22:40.892
Iced Raspberry Bellini
and Cotton Candy Champagne.

00:22:40.892 --> 00:22:42.461
-Still come with the
Winter Peach Marshmallow,

00:22:42.461 --> 00:22:43.995
though, right?
-[ Chuckling ] Oh,

00:22:43.995 --> 00:22:46.331
you tell me.
-Oh!

00:22:46.331 --> 00:22:47.565
[ Cheering and applause ]
That's my dude.

00:22:47.565 --> 00:22:49.200
-Waiting all year for this, man.

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:50.602
-[ Laughing ] That's my dude.

00:22:50.602 --> 00:22:52.069
[ Laughter ]
Oh, no, wait, Higgins.

00:22:52.069 --> 00:22:54.806
[ Ohs and applause ]
Higgins,

00:22:54.806 --> 00:22:57.842
[ Laughter ]
are you eating a melted candle?

00:22:57.842 --> 00:22:59.010
-No!

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:00.511
I filled this thing up
with pudding.

00:23:00.511 --> 00:23:03.248
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, okay. Well, what flavor?

00:23:03.248 --> 00:23:04.982
-Pine.
-Ah, very nice.

00:23:04.982 --> 00:23:08.019
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:23:11.156 --> 00:23:12.423
Well, I --
-Mmm!

00:23:12.423 --> 00:23:15.660
[ Laughter ]

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:16.594
So good.

00:23:16.594 --> 00:23:18.662
[ Slurping ]
-I read that...

00:23:18.662 --> 00:23:20.732
[ Laughter ]
Turn the lights.

00:23:20.732 --> 00:23:22.233
Turn the tree on!
Turn the tree on!

00:23:22.233 --> 00:23:23.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:23:23.934 --> 00:23:26.137
I read that Zoom just rolled out

00:23:26.137 --> 00:23:28.340 line:0%
a new feature called
Attendance Status

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:30.375 line:0%
that makes it easier
to see who's at a meeting

00:23:30.375 --> 00:23:32.377 line:0%
and whether anyone
showed up late,

00:23:32.377 --> 00:23:34.112 line:0%
[ Ohs and booing ]
which is why they're

00:23:34.112 --> 00:23:36.847 line:0%
changing the name
from Zoom to...

00:23:36.847 --> 00:23:39.017 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:23:39.017 --> 00:23:41.552
-Come on!
-Come on, man.

00:23:41.552 --> 00:23:43.888
And now Skype is trying
to capitalize on this.

00:23:43.888 --> 00:23:44.956
That's right, their new motto is

00:23:44.956 --> 00:23:47.158
"Skype --
where snitches get stitches."

00:23:47.158 --> 00:23:49.393
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:23:49.393 --> 00:23:50.695
Well, it's the holiday season

00:23:50.695 --> 00:23:51.963
and everyone's getting
packages delivered,

00:23:51.963 --> 00:23:53.832
but there's one house
in Tennessee

00:23:53.832 --> 00:23:55.400
that might have taken it
a little too far.

00:23:55.400 --> 00:23:56.701
Check this out.

00:23:56.701 --> 00:23:58.202
[ Ohs and laughter ]
Look at this.

00:23:58.202 --> 00:24:00.505
Look at that.
That's what happens when you

00:24:00.505 --> 00:24:02.306
give a three-year-old
your phone for five minutes.

00:24:02.306 --> 00:24:03.775
[ Laughter ]
That's what.

00:24:03.775 --> 00:24:05.777
The UPS guy's going to lose his
mind when the owner's like,

00:24:05.777 --> 00:24:07.545
"I need to make
a very large return."

00:24:07.545 --> 00:24:08.847
[ Laughter ]

00:24:08.847 --> 00:24:11.482
Also, I saw that a bride
in North Carolina went viral

00:24:11.482 --> 00:24:12.750
for celebrating her wedding

00:24:12.750 --> 00:24:14.685
with a mannequin of her husband

00:24:14.685 --> 00:24:16.988
because he got food poisoning
on the big day.

00:24:16.988 --> 00:24:19.056
Check this out.
It's real. Yeah.

00:24:19.056 --> 00:24:21.192
[ Laughter ]

00:24:21.192 --> 00:24:23.594
Their wedding was actually
delayed twice because of COVID

00:24:23.594 --> 00:24:25.563
and then, the groom
got food poisoning.

00:24:25.563 --> 00:24:27.765
And, each time, the bride said,
"God, if I'm making a mistake,

00:24:27.765 --> 00:24:28.733
give me a sign.

00:24:28.733 --> 00:24:30.301
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:24:30.301 --> 00:24:31.703
Give me --"

00:24:33.904 --> 00:24:36.273 line:0%
Guys, the NFL just suspended
three players,

00:24:36.273 --> 00:24:39.244 line:0%
including Tampa Bay Buccaneers
star receiver Antonio Brown,

00:24:39.244 --> 00:24:42.513 line:0%
for turning in
fake vaccine cards.

00:24:42.513 --> 00:24:44.415
The NFL got suspicious
when, under doctor,

00:24:44.415 --> 00:24:45.417
it said "Aaron Rodgers."

